headers {
  Origin: {{origin}}
  X-KlubHub-CSRF: 1
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  KlubHub Promoter API collection. Run it through scripts/test-promoter-api.sh,
  which starts a disposable database and API and passes baseUrl, origin,
  ownerEmail, ownerPassword and setupToken with --env-var. Requests are
  ordered and chained with runtime variables (bru.setVar); run the whole
  collection with -r, not single requests.

  Session cookies are __Host- + Secure, so no cookie jar stores them over
  plain http: requests capture them from Set-Cookie into runtime variables
  and send an explicit Cookie header. Run with --disable-cookies.
}
